<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        .container {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 40px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .header h2 {
            color: #3266CC;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .content {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .success-badge {
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            display: inline-block;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .info-box {
            background-color: #f4f7f6;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .info-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }
        .info-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .info-label {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #666;
        }
        .info-value {
            color: #333;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .highlight {
            background-color: #e3f2fd;
            padding: 15px;
            border-left: 4px solid #2196F3;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .account-number {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #3266CC;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: #f0f4ff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999999;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <img src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="Abittoenergy Logo" style="max-width: 200px; height: auto;" />
        </div>
        <div class="header">
            <h2>Your Dedicated Virtual Account is Ready! 🏦</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>
            
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <span class="success-badge">✓ Account Created</span>
            </div>
            
            <p>Great news! We've successfully created a dedicated virtual account for you. You can now top up your Abittoenergy wallet instantly by transferring money to this account.</p>
            
            <div class="highlight">
                <p><strong>Your Dedicated Account Number:</strong></p>
                <div class="account-number">{{accountNumber}}</div>
                <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0;"><strong>Bank: {{bankName}}</strong></p>
            </div>

            <div class="info-box">
                <p><strong>Account Details:</strong></p>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Account Name:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{accountName}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Account Number:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{accountNumber}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Bank:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{bankName}}</span>
                </div>
                {{#if customerEmail}}
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Email:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{customerEmail}}</span>
                </div>
                {{/if}}
            </div>

            <p><strong>How to use your virtual account:</strong></p>
            <ol>
                <li>Transfer any amount from your bank to the account number above</li>
                <li>Your Abittoenergy wallet will be credited automatically within seconds</li>
                <li>Use your wallet balance to purchase gas for your meter instantly</li>
            </ol>

            <div class="highlight">
                <p><strong>Important Notes:</strong></p>
                <ul style="margin: 10px 0;">
                    <li>This account is exclusively for your Abittoenergy wallet top-ups</li>
                    <li>Transfers are processed instantly 24/7</li>
                    <li>There are no transaction fees for using this account</li>
                    <li>Keep this account number safe and don't share it with anyone</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <p>You can view your wallet balance and transaction history anytime by logging into your dashboard.</p>
            
            <p>If you have any questions about your virtual account, please don't hesitate to contact our support team.</p>
            
            <p>Happy topping up!</p>
            
            <p>Best regards,<br>The Abittoenergy Team</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Abittoenergy. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
